---
interface Props {language?:'ko'|'en'}
const {language='ko'}=Astro.props; const ko=language==='ko';
---
<section class="gpu-lab" data-gpu-lab data-language={language}>
<p class="eyebrow">THE ARCHIVE / GPU ECONOMICS LAB</p><h3>{ko?'GPU 경제성 실험':'GPU Economics Explorer'}</h3><p>{ko?'모든 입력값은 가상 시나리오입니다. 품질과 워크로드가 같다고 가정합니다.':'All inputs are hypothetical. Equal quality and workload are assumed.'}</p>
<p class="slider-help">{ko?'슬라이더를 움직여 가정을 바꾸면 아래 결과가 바로 업데이트됩니다. 각 값은 가상 입력입니다.':'Move the sliders to update the results instantly. Each value is a hypothetical input.'}</p><div class="lab-step"><div class="step-title"><span>01</span><div><h4>{ko?'추론 비용 비교':'Compare inference costs'}</h4><p>{ko?'구형 GPU는 얼마에 경쟁할 수 있을까?':'At what price can an older GPU compete?'}</p></div></div>
<div class="inputs"><label>{ko?'구형 GPU 시간당 가격 ($)':'Older GPU $/hour'} <output data-value="oldPrice">$1.50 / h</output><input name="oldPrice" type="range" min="0" max="10" step="0.05" value="1.5" /></label><label>{ko?'구형 GPU 초당 토큰':'Older GPU tokens/second'} <output data-value="oldTps">40 tok/s</output><input name="oldTps" type="range" min="1" max="5000" step="1" value="40" /></label><label>{ko?'신형 GPU 시간당 가격 ($)':'New GPU $/hour'} <output data-value="newPrice">$4.00 / h</output><input name="newPrice" type="range" min="0" max="15" step="0.05" value="4" /></label><label>{ko?'신형 GPU 초당 토큰':'New GPU tokens/second'} <output data-value="newTps">120 tok/s</output><input name="newTps" type="range" min="1" max="5000" step="1" value="120" /></label></div>
<div class="result-grid" aria-live="polite" data-result><div class="result-card featured"><span>{ko?'구형 GPU 경쟁가격':'Older GPU break-even'}</span><strong data-out="breakEven">$1.33 / h</strong><small>{ko?'신형과 토큰당 비용이 같아지는 가격':'Price at equal cost per token'}</small></div><div class="result-card"><span>{ko?'구형 · 100만 토큰당':'Older · per million tokens'}</span><strong data-out="oldCost">$10.42</strong><small>{ko?'가상 실효 처리량 기준':'Based on hypothetical throughput'}</small></div><div class="result-card"><span>{ko?'신형 · 100만 토큰당':'Newer · per million tokens'}</span><strong data-out="newCost">$9.26</strong><small>{ko?'동일 품질·워크로드 가정':'Assumes equal workload and quality'}</small></div></div></div>
<div class="lab-step"><div class="step-title"><span>02</span><div><h4>{ko?'신규 투자 현금흐름':'New investment cash flow'}</h4><p>{ko?'이 임대료로 투자비를 회수할 수 있을까?':'Can this rent recover the investment?'}</p></div></div><label><input name="linkBreakEven" type="checkbox" /> {ko?'위의 손익분기 가격을 자산 임대료에 적용':'Apply the break-even price above to the asset rental rate'}</label><div class="inputs"><label>{ko?'시간당 임대료 ($)':'Rental $/hour'} <output data-value="rent">$3.00 / h</output><input name="rent" type="range" min="0" max="15" step="0.05" value="3" /></label><label>{ko?'유료 가동률':'Paid utilization'} <output data-value="util">70%</output><input name="util" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.7" /></label><label>{ko?'할인율':'Discount rate'} <output data-value="discount">12%</output><input name="discount" type="range" min="0" max="0.5" step="0.01" value="0.12" /></label><label>{ko?'최초 3년 계약':'First three-year contract'} <select name="contract"><option value="on_demand">On-demand</option><option value="take_or_pay">Take-or-pay · 98% availability</option></select></label></div>
<div class="result-grid" aria-live="polite" data-npv><div class="result-card featured"><span>{ko?'신규 투자 NPV':'New investment NPV'}</span><strong data-out="npv">−$16,315</strong><small>{ko?'미래 현금흐름의 현재가치':'Present value after initial investment'}</small></div><div class="result-card"><span>{ko?'적용 임대료':'Applied rental rate'}</span><strong data-out="rent">$3.00 / h</strong><small>{ko?'첫 3년의 가정':'Assumed first-three-year rate'}</small></div><div class="result-card"><span>{ko?'NPV 0을 위한 임대료':'Rent for zero NPV'}</span><strong data-out="required">$3.89 / h</strong><small>{ko?'다른 가정이 일정할 때':'Holding other assumptions constant'}</small></div></div><p>{ko?'GPU $30,000 + 인프라 $12,000, 운영·유지 $7,500/년. 계약 만료 후 70% 갱신확률, 가격 55%, 이후 연 12% 하락. 6년 말 잔존 $3,000. 세금 0. 최적 처분·교체 시점과 IRR은 계산하지 않습니다.':'GPU $30,000 + infrastructure $12,000; annual operating and maintenance $7,500. After expiry: 70% renewal probability, 55% price, then 12% annual decline. $3,000 salvage in year six. Tax zero. Optimal retirement and IRR are not calculated.'}</p></div>
<div class="lab-step"><div class="step-title"><span>03</span><div><h4>{ko?'기존 GPU의 재계약':'Renewal of an existing GPU'}</h4><p>{ko?'계속 운영할까, 지금 매각할까?':'Continue operating or sell now?'}</p></div></div>
<p>{ko?'가상 사례. 남은 3년의 기대 현금흐름을 계약 종료 시점으로 할인합니다. 기존 취득원가는 매몰비용이며, 아래 매각대금과 별도로 차감하지 않습니다.':'Hypothetical case. Remaining three-year expected cash flows are discounted to the expiry date. Acquisition cost is sunk and is not deducted again from sale proceeds.'}</p>
<div class="inputs"><label>{ko?'재계약 가격 ($/시간)':'Renewal rent ($/hour)'} <output data-value="renewRent">$1.65 / h</output><input name="renewRent" type="range" min="0" max="15" step="0.05" value="1.65" /></label><label>{ko?'재계약 확률':'Renewal probability'} <output data-value="renewProb">70%</output><input name="renewProb" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.7" /></label><label>{ko?'즉시 처분대금 ($)':'Sale proceeds now ($)'} <output data-value="sellNow">$4,000</output><input name="sellNow" type="range" min="0" max="30000" step="100" value="4000" /></label></div>
<div class="result-grid" aria-live="polite" data-continuation><div class="result-card featured"><span>{ko?'계속 운영 가치':'Continue value'}</span><strong data-out="continue">−$682</strong><small>{ko?'남은 현금흐름의 현재가치':'PV of remaining cash flows'}</small></div><div class="result-card"><span>{ko?'즉시 매각대금':'Sale proceeds now'}</span><strong data-out="sale">$4,000</strong><small>{ko?'현재 시점의 가정':'Assumed proceeds today'}</small></div><div class="result-card"><span>{ko?'가정에 따른 선택':'Preferred under assumptions'}</span><strong class="decision" data-out="decision">{ko?'즉시 매각':'Sell now'}</strong><small>{ko?'두 대안의 가치 비교':'Based on the two values'}</small></div></div><p>{ko?'남은 3년: 위의 유료 가동률·할인율을 사용, 재계약 가격 연 12% 하락, 운영·유지비 연 $7,500, 3년 말 잔존가치 $3,000. 갱신 실패에도 운영비 발생. 세금·부채·교체 및 전용 가치는 제외한 조건부 비교입니다.':'Remaining three years use utilization and discount rate above, 12% annual price decline, $7,500 annual operating and maintenance costs, and $3,000 terminal salvage. Costs remain even if renewal fails. Conditional comparison excludes tax, debt, replacement and alternative-use value.'}</p></div>
</section>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-gpu-lab]').forEach(root=>{const ko=root.dataset.language==='ko';const n=(name:string)=>Number(root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[name="${name}"]`)?.value);const render=()=>{const amounts=['oldPrice','newPrice','rent','renewRent'];const percentages=['util','discount','renewProb'];root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[type=range]').forEach(el=>{const value=Number(el.value),output=root.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>(`[data-value="${el.name}"]`);const display=percentages.includes(el.name)?`${Math.round(value*100)}%`:amounts.includes(el.name)?`$${value.toFixed(2)} / h`:el.name==='sellNow'?`$${value.toLocaleString('en-US')}`:`${value.toLocaleString('en-US')} tok/s`;if(output)output.value=display;el.setAttribute('aria-valuetext',display)});const link=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="linkBreakEven"]')!.checked;root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="rent"]')!.disabled=link;const a=n('oldPrice'),b=n('oldTps'),c=n('newPrice'),d=n('newTps'),inputRent=n('rent'),linked=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="linkBreakEven"]')!.checked,rent=linked?c*b/d:inputRent,u=n('util'),r=n('discount');if(![a,b,c,d,rent,u,r].every(Number.isFinite)||a<0||c<0||rent<0||b<=0||d<=0||u<0||u>1||r<0){return}const oldCost=1e6*a/(3600*b),newCost=1e6*c/(3600*d);const write=(name:string,value:string)=>{root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-out="${name}"]`)!.textContent=value};write('breakEven',`$${(c*b/d).toFixed(2)} / h`);write('oldCost',`$${oldCost.toFixed(2)}`);write('newCost',`$${newCost.toFixed(2)}`);let npv=-42000,zero=-42000,unit=-42000;const kind=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[name="contract"]')!.value;for(let t=1;t<=6;t++){const demand=kind==='take_or_pay'&&t<=3?.98:u;const renewal=t<=3?1:.7;const price=t<=3?rent:rent*.55*Math.pow(.88,t-4);const flow=8760*demand*renewal*price-7500+(t===6?3000:0);const factor=1/Math.pow(1+r,t);npv+=flow*factor;const fixed=-7500+(t===6?3000:0);zero+=fixed*factor;unit+=(8760*demand*renewal*(t<=3?1:.55*Math.pow(.88,t-4))+fixed)*factor}const required=unit>zero?-zero/(unit-zero):NaN;const renewRent=n('renewRent'),renewProb=n('renewProb'),sellNow=n('sellNow');let continuation=0;if([renewRent,renewProb,sellNow].every(Number.isFinite)&&renewRent>=0&&renewProb>=0&&renewProb<=1&&sellNow>=0){for(let t=1;t<=3;t++){continuation+=(8760*u*renewProb*renewRent*Math.pow(.88,t-1)-7500+(t===3?3000:0))/Math.pow(1+r,t)}write('continue',`${continuation<0?'−':''}$${Math.abs(continuation).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:0})}`);write('sale',`$${sellNow.toLocaleString('en-US')}`);write('decision',continuation>sellNow?(ko?'계속 운영':'Continue'):continuation<sellNow?(ko?'즉시 매각':'Sell now'):(ko?'가치 동일':'Equal value'))}else{write('continue','—');write('sale','—');write('decision','—')}write('rent',`$${rent.toFixed(2)} / h`);write('npv',`${npv<0?'−':''}$${Math.abs(npv).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:0})}`);write('required',Number.isFinite(required)?`$${required.toFixed(2)} / h`:'—');};root.querySelectorAll('input,select').forEach(e=>e.addEventListener('input',render));render();});
</script>
<style>
.gpu-lab{padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid #c8d6e5;border-radius:16px;background:#f3f7fc;color:#25344a;font-family:var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.gpu-lab *{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0}.gpu-lab p{line-height:1.65}.eyebrow{font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;color:#517da4}.gpu-lab h3{margin:.3rem 0;font-size:1.5rem}.slider-help{font-size:.86rem;color:#496681}.lab-step{padding:1.2rem;margin:1.2rem 0;border:1px solid #d0deeb;border-radius:14px;background:#fff}.lab-step>p{font-size:.8rem;color:#52677b}.step-title{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.8rem;margin-bottom:1.1rem}.step-title>span{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#e2edf8;color:#315f89;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.step-title h4{margin:0;font-size:1.05rem;color:inherit}.step-title p{margin:.25rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem;color:#617890}.inputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem}.inputs label{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:.35rem .7rem;padding:.75rem;border:1px solid #e3eaf2;border-radius:9px;background:#f8fafd;font-size:.82rem}.inputs label input[type=range],.inputs label select{grid-column:1 / -1;width:100%}.inputs input[type=range]{accent-color:#426f9c;cursor:pointer;min-height:34px}.inputs input[type=range]:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}.inputs select{padding:.5rem;border:1px solid #b4c5d7;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;color:#25344a}.inputs output{font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;color:#315f89}.result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem;margin:1rem 0}.result-card{padding:.8rem;border:1px solid #d8e4ef;border-radius:10px;background:#f6f9fc}.result-card.featured{background:#eaf2fa;border-color:#bad0e4}.result-card span,.result-card small{display:block;font-size:.72rem;color:#536c83;line-height:1.45}.result-card strong{display:block;margin:.35rem 0;color:#244e75;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.2;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.result-card strong.decision{font-size:1rem}.lab-step>label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:.85rem}.lab-step>label input{accent-color:#426f9c}@media(max-width:620px){.inputs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.result-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.result-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.2rem .5rem;align-items:center}.result-card strong{margin:0}.result-card small{grid-column:1 / -1}.lab-step{padding:1rem}}:global(html.dark) .gpu-lab{background:#1d2632;color:#edf2f9;border-color:#48566b}:global(html.dark) .lab-step{background:#263342;border-color:#48566b}:global(html.dark) .inputs label,:global(html.dark) .result-card{background:#202c3a;border-color:#48566b}:global(html.dark) .result-card.featured{background:#2c4257;border-color:#597794}:global(html.dark) .inputs output,:global(html.dark) .result-card strong{color:#b8daf7}:global(html.dark) .lab-step>p,:global(html.dark) .step-title p,:global(html.dark) .result-card span,:global(html.dark) .result-card small,:global(html.dark) .slider-help{color:#bfd0df}:global(html.dark) .inputs select{background:#202c3a;color:#edf2f9;border-color:#597794}
</style>
